<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41401" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rē-stagno</span></b> , āre,
			v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to run over</i>, <i>overflow;</i> of
			bodies of water: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paludes restagnantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					44, 46, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ostium amnis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					44, 6, 15</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 5, 5, § 34</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">restagnantis fecit maris unda paludem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 11, 364</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flumen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc. 4,
					89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					8, 382</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 2, 12, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 15,
				3</span></i>.—<b>Transf.</b>, of the
			inundated place: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">late is locus restagnat,</span>”
				<i>is overflowed</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 2, 24 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arva palude,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					4, 752</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
